{
  "note": "Reviewed direct controls, hidden-page input release, failed-join retry, enhanced resume after event-write failure, and fixed-tick attached motion. Ship verification passed 29 motion unit scenarios (including hitch equivalence and wall rollback with reconnect grace), 27 recovery/benchmark unit scenarios, and four Hauler/reconnect/desktop-mobile Wiki integration scenarios. Inspected the new desktop/mobile Wiki and live Hauler cable captures. Reviewed the asteroid motion and recovery articles and existing demonstrations: normal 60 Hz rules and wall-clock grace are unchanged, so no media regeneration is needed. Lint, types, benchmark types, YAML, and action contracts passed. Earlier sustained measurements retain their original source hashes.",
